[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4403165887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4403165887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4403165887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBnL6vw","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T03:53:51Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T03:53:51Z","body":"> When exporting a scene to a MeshLibrary, it will autofill item categories if the MeshInstance3Ds contain the metadata \"category\" with a String value.\r\n\r\nWouldn't it make more sense if you could add mesh instances to nodes and we take the category from that? So say for Kenneys prototype kit you'd end up with a node tree like:\r\n<img width=\"507\" height=\"504\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f0cfa8a-a3b0-44c7-bd7b-f76f061b3029\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4403165887/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4404998790","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4404998790","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4404998790,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBo7yhg","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T08:41:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T08:41:03Z","body":"I was going to suggest a similar idea, using the scene tree hierarchy in the .tscn to categorise the meshes. That would also allow to create GLB files that can be imported directly as MeshLibrary. But it is probably worth its own PR?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4404998790/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4410427719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4410427719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4410427719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBuHJRw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T22:49:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T22:49:52Z","body":"@BastiaanOlij Not sure how well this would work with the `categorize_by_name` property. Should it work together with `category` then instead of the latter taking priority?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4410427719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4411298392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4411298392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4411298392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBu8SWA","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T03:36:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T03:36:29Z","body":"> @BastiaanOlij Not sure how well this would work with the `categorize_by_name` property. Should it work together with `category` then instead of the latter taking priority?\r\n\r\nIf we want to keep the property, yes, I would say that the property takes priority to the name of the parent.\r\n\r\nBut personally I feel that taking the category from the node structure makes it much easier to manage, lowers the risk of typos duplicating categories, and gives you easy visual feedback of the organisation of the nodes while putting a scene together. Especially as you may add additional things to the scene (and thus the mesh library) later on as you build out a level and find out you need additional meshes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4411298392/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4411930400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4411930400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4411930400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBvi3IA","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T07:43:47Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T07:43:47Z","body":"I really like the scene tree idea, I can see it work for my project, but I wonder how it would scale for AAA game assets such as Morrowind or Fallout 3. Maybe we could reach their modding community to get a sample of assets to test our tools with.\r\n\r\nConcerning the `categorize_by_name`, I would say that it could be an import option or an action in editor that will parse the categories and create the corresponding node tree, so that the .tscn is ready to be exported as a MeshLibrary.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4411930400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4414174205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4414174205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4414174205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBxrz_Q","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T01:46:22Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T01:46:22Z","body":"> I really like the scene tree idea, I can see it work for my project, but I wonder how it would scale for AAA game assets such as Morrowind or Fallout 3. Maybe we could reach their modding community to get a sample of assets to test our tools with.\r\n\r\nIt would be great to get our hands on that sort of a resource. They will have some sort of categorisation going too. I fear that it's likely going to be a folder structure with separate meshes per asset (which would be an interesting thing to automate too).\r\n\r\nI don't see how the custom property + `category_by_name` would solve this though. It all depends on where the category names comes from, if someone manually needs to set the categories in the editor, that is the least efficient way of doing things, and also the most risky if re-importing assets from source could overwrite the data.\r\n\r\nTo make it reproducible on import, you would either want to adhere to a naming convention, e.g. call all meshes `<catergory>_<object>`, or have the structure already in place in your source assets, e.g. making sure you're already grouping in categories in blender which I would assume would result in grouping nodes being created on import.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4414174205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4454074050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4454074050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4454074050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCXvGwg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T19:31:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T19:31:40Z","body":"After some talk in the dev chat, it was decided that we should first get the categories feature out of the door first, then add more features in the scene exporter later on.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4454074050/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4782932071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119319#issuecomment-4782932071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119319","id":4782932071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHRXAZw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://